"welcome.gpg.passphraseNote" = "ℹ SimpleZip does NOT manage or cache your GPG private-key passphrase — unlocking is handled entirely by your local gpg-agent + pinentry-mac. If GPG-related issues come up, check your gpg / pinentry / key trust configuration first.";
